OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRain will be
OL,6,Fwidespread and heavy at times this
OL,7,Fevening, clearing east overnight to
OL,8,Fleave most areas dry, with only the
OL,9,Fodd light shower at times.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTuesday:FA bright but rather breezy
OL,12,Fday with a few sunny spells between
OL,13,Flight scattered showers, these most
OL,14,Flikely in the west.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FA
OL,17,Fchangeable period with showers or
OL,18,Flonger spells of rain, particularly on
OL,19,FWednesday where showers may be heavy.
OL,20,FStaying quite cool for the time of
OL,21,Fyear.
